/// The Nemesis mark used by the Flutter splash, embedded in code (no asset
/// / pubspec entry needed) and decoded BEFORE the first frame so it is on
/// screen from frame one - exactly where the native splash left it.
///
/// It is the same artwork as the native splash logo
/// (res/drawable-*/splash_logo.png) and the launcher icon's foreground
/// layer, at the highest (xxxhdpi) resolution so it stays sharp on every
/// screen, with a 2 dp fully transparent margin on every side so no stroke
/// of the mark can ever touch (and be clipped by) the edge of the image.
/// The margin is symmetric, so the image's centre IS the mark's centre, and
/// the visible mark is exactly 102 x 118 dp inside the 106 x 122 dp canvas.
/// The native splash draws the very same canvas at the screen centre, so the
/// two splashes line up exactly.
